[{"title":"赛西施","author":"杨循吉","text":"越国佳人天下奇，此花尤更美丰姿。\n当时若使吴王见，肯醉芙蓉太液池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25932,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白西施","author":"杨循吉","text":"腻粉脂容玉雪肤，花神瑩白羡吴姬。\n秋风素魄东篱下，不逐鸱夷泛五湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25933,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉杨妃","author":"杨循吉","text":"一枝无力倚娉婷，曾记真妃醉未醒。\n不道沈香亭畔宠，秋风篱落易飘零。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25934,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孩儿菊","author":"杨循吉","text":"软玉肌肤腻粉姿，啼痕彷佛露香垂。\n一枝低卧苔烟上，似向花房压被时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25935,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胜黄金","author":"杨循吉","text":"中黄一气禀坤宫，苑北园南色更浓。\n总使秋阳如烈火，肯随朝露便消融。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25936,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉钱菊","author":"杨循吉","text":"不随九府铸青铜，刻玉雕琼巧用工。\n忆共花钿零落后，至今狼籍怨秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25937,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒菊","author":"杨循吉","text":"金蕊荧煌翠叶圆，移栽花屋最宜看。\n一冬斋阁深深闭，留待秋香到岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25938,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄牡丹","author":"杨循吉","text":"京洛豪华迹已陈，姚家春色对何人。\n于今寂寞东篱畔，又作黄花十度新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25939,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小金莲","author":"杨循吉","text":"黄金小朵烂光辉，曾近雕阑照绣衣。\n几度醉看花上月，绝胜宫烛夜深归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25940,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白荔枝","author":"杨循吉","text":"娉得娇如十八娘，肥肤清润雪生香。\n阿环此日能相见，忆却金盘玉露浆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25941,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉菡萏","author":"杨循吉","text":"分得瑶池种最奇，半含香露尚开迟。\n风清月白东篱畔，犹忆江边欲堕时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25942,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫丁香","author":"杨循吉","text":"番舶何人得种来，紫尖香蕊果奇哉。\n春风枝上相思恨，结到秋深尚未开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25943,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉兔华","author":"杨循吉","text":"广寒玉兔落阴精，秀结秋风一种青。\n却笑风霜憔悴死，虚劳捣药济长生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25944,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸳鸯菊","author":"杨循吉","text":"韩朋魂魄旧风流，结就花枝也并头。\n千载未消连理恨，尚留残蝶恋深秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25945,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹤翎白","author":"杨循吉","text":"何处仙胎脱缟衣，傲霜枝上弄清辉。\n可怜不得青田梦，几度临风秪欲飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25946,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剪鹅翎","author":"杨循吉","text":"鹢鹢霜毫蜕满池，天工碎剪上花枝。\n折来插在乌纱畔，绝胜春蛾点鬓丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25947,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"麝香黄","author":"杨循吉","text":"谁向西风剖麝香，馀芳浓染露华黄。\n秋光老圃无人识，石竹丛丛蔓草荒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25948,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莺羽黄","author":"杨循吉","text":"流莺春梦落东篱，金缕衣裳忆旧时。\n五柳门前飞不去，羽毛零露作花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25949,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叠雪罗","author":"杨循吉","text":"宫衣朝赐雪生香，团扇春风日正长。\n此际看花还旧色，重阳错认是端阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25950,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"僧鞋菊","author":"杨循吉","text":"凫舄当年巧制裁，曾随老衲步云台。\n逃禅误落东篱下，化作霜花九月开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25951,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"销金菊","author":"杨循吉","text":"谁抹泥金上绛绡，要将花蕊斗春娇。\n党家帐里清歌歇，一点馀香尚未消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25952,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金铃菊","author":"杨循吉","text":"黄宫小朵缀金铃，风动花枝似有声。\n曾忆绛罗帏幄底，飞来山鸟亦相惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25953,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉连环","author":"杨循吉","text":"雕琼刻玉斗玲珑，奇巧分明出化工。\n都作连环钩结相，不教花片逐春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25954,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜡瓣红","author":"杨循吉","text":"煜煜丹葩滴露浓，蜜脾光暖惹游蜂。\n花神恐怕偷香去，故把芳心绛蜡封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25955,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫霞杯","author":"杨循吉","text":"临风翠袖立徘徊，似捧流霞潋滟杯。\n却忆当年陶令宅，花前几度玉山颓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25956,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百花庵主见访","author":"杨循吉","text":"一春高卧只垂帘，说着浮名病又添。\n闻道百花庵可往，他时容我读华严。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25957,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中寄答诸相知先生","author":"萧显","text":"伤离怀故人，无由一缩地。\n和得相思词，殷勤附驿使。\n词中何所云，交好情难昧。\n落日动客愁，临风起遐思。\n棹惊白鸟翻，岸转青山厕。\n隔水有烟萝，摇摇见苍翠。\n数日计行期，流光若飞骑。\n丈夫不家食，到处聊适意。\n况有临分语，矢言遵所示。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25958,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"萧显","text":"遥忆江南景，寒梅冬著花。\n上元柑饱壳，谷雨茗收芽。\n此日闻边雁，回风带暮鸦。\n归山不轻出，净寂似僧家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25959,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镇东楼同陈司马饮","author":"萧显","text":"登赏因逃暑，吟哦幸遇君。\n雨馀山水涨，风细野芳芬。\n近渚鸥寻侣，排空雁逐群。\n庾公千载后，高兴计谁分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25960,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种竹","author":"萧显","text":"种竹西涯满，清风日在君。\n故根依净土，新叶拂晴云。\n簇簇龙孙长，翛翛凤吹闻。\n我行频欲过，藉此避尘氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25961,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游普定寺次方伯周子建韵","author":"萧显","text":"坐阅残经久，兴亡一梦中。\n方塘澄水月，曲涧响松风。\n禅悟三乘妙，心虚万法空。\n我来幽兴发，吟对晚霞红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25962,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑侍御坐失仪外补","author":"萧显","text":"十年持豸斧，到处即声驰。\n病骨崚层日，天威战慄时。\n朝恭元自重，圣泽本无涯。\n暂借亲民瘼，无烦叹别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25963,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荫秀亭","author":"萧显","text":"爱此园林好，凭高眼界馀。\n鲸声吞海阔，鹤迹印沙虚。\n午饷炊农饭，晨兴课子书。\n天机自流动，何必咏鸢鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25964,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"围春庄山居","author":"萧显","text":"过山庄便是，十里路非遥。\n白鹤鸣孤嶂，清声彻九霄。\n海翁閒弄钓，野水暗通桥。\n明月清风侣，来时不用邀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25965,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘信之分教云阳","author":"萧显","text":"宫漏催残欲曙天，儒官辞阙向西川。\n过家白发怜亲老，分教青衿得士贤。\n舟出九江春见雁，道经三峡晓闻鹃。\n吾乡自昔多才俊，师席声华到日边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25966,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒陵","author":"萧显","text":"面辞丹陛谒皇陵，十里桥前尽却乘。\n国祚万年绵大统，鼎湖千载忆遐升。\n更催玉漏犹残滴，班列丹霄最上层。\n祀事已终归去急，拟陈哀颂愧非能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25967,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邀李西涯游城西寺","author":"萧显","text":"晓日联镳出帝州，西园名胜共君游。\n看花已觉今非昨，观稼还知岁有秋。\n果杂冰盘高树下，酒分磁瓮小桥头。\n投壶对奕心俱适，忘却人间别有愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25968,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次王守备韵","author":"萧显","text":"草亭新构绝尘侵，雅称将军逸乐心。\n能以文谟资武略，顿令城市有山林。\n秋清抚景诗频咏，公暇娱情酒谩斟。\n晚节更怜丛菊在，西风吹绽满篱金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25969,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将至清泉怀诸相知","author":"萧显","text":"朱函宝册下尧廷，千里兼程水陆经。\n避节尘氛天外静，对船山色雨中青。\n源泉去我馀三日，瀚海何人识二星。\n尚忆昔年游赏处，一杯曾共醉林坰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25970,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"萧显","text":"此地重逢挺节筠，清风潇洒最怡神。\n十年阔别浑如旧，竟日相看不厌频。\n采采凤鸾鸣盛世，珊珊环佩下严宸。\n岁寒有约期无负，迟暮林间定可亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25971,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示子孙","author":"萧显","text":"寻常拂拭旧琴星，心赏音谐手未停。\n郭外探春花欲发，庭前欺雪竹还青。\n风回海钓机心息，月上山窗尘梦醒。\n晓起教儿读周易，客来休问太玄经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25972,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"围春庄杂感 其一","author":"萧显","text":"三十年来涉宦途，乞归华发半头颅。\n依山结屋尘偏静，临水观鱼兴不孤。\n野老崎岖寻橡实，林僧谈笑断松腴。\n离家几作还家梦，一夜团栾骨肉俱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25973,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"围春庄杂感 其二","author":"萧显","text":"六十九翁过洞仙，杖藜浑不惮跻攀。\n琴书携取消晴昼，水石凭将慰老颜。\n閒把纶竿清濑处，醉眠茅屋白云间。\n有时徙倚阑干立，目断孤鸿天外还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25974,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南海","author":"萧显","text":"入夜潮声十里闻，气连霄汉自氤氲。\n舟航吴越长风便，襟带幽燕孔道分。\n蛟在室中吞怪物，蜃成楼处见妖氛。\n有时三岛开晴霁，彷佛群仙拥绛云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25975,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镇东楼","author":"萧显","text":"城上危楼控朔庭，百蛮朝贡往来经。\n八窗虚敞堪延月，重槛高寒可摘星。\n风鼓怒涛惊海怪，雷轰幽谷泣山灵。\n几回浩笑掀髯坐，羌笛一声天外听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25976,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述事用唐人早朝诗韵","author":"萧显","text":"春期巳尽晓犹寒，吟遍群峰独倚栏。\n桃种岂殊仙子宅，松封曾号大夫官。\n日长人静门重掩，雨过苔深径不乾。\n爱此山林真有癖，早投簪绂未曾难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25977,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"士常席上送乃兄士仪","author":"萧显","text":"东楼杯酒惜离群，柳色春光日未分。\n姜被剧谈中夜雨，祖鞭遥指出关云。\n山城朔雁联翩起，野店昏鸡远近闻。\n邂逅别来相忆地，醉歌终日任醺醺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25978,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即席赠士常","author":"萧显","text":"病后休闻久废诗，强开涓滴共相知。\n也堪筋力逢春健，不为盘餐竟日辞。\n庭雀脱笼舒倦翼，辙鳞惊雨振枯鬐。\n相看各有飞扬意，醉解吴钩赠别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25979,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即席怀鸣治","author":"萧显","text":"风流不见谢临川，俊逸空惭李谪仙。\n得句向人谁可否，论交于世几方圆。\n小车望断幽花外，短屐行来古树边。\n落日在庭犹拥彗，不胜春思满离筵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25980,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元基席上再送士仪","author":"萧显","text":"离席因君荐木桃，碧缸新酒泻春涛。\n诗盟递结东西社，坐客平分上下曹。\n帘动午风花气暖，几当晴日篆烟高。\n狂歌亦是骊驹曲，三叠阳关意未豪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25981,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游广恩寺 其一","author":"萧显","text":"五粒松间一草亭，四窗虚敞不须扃。\n乾坤著此容吾到，江海逢人笑我醒。\n寥落东林修净社，摩挲华表蚀残铭。\n杏花满地飘红雪，到手深杯莫放停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25982,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游广恩寺 其二","author":"萧显","text":"惯客山童说果名，又将幽事恼春情。\n杏林百匝寻奇句，竹院三回说旧盟。\n酒瓮倒倾杳不断，花枝频折意还生。\n林鸠唤雨催行急，敢为田家惜此声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25983,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游慈恩寺二首 其一","author":"萧显","text":"十年曾记此中游，今日重来未白头。\n杨柳柴门孤犬吠，桔槔蔬圃一泉流。\n行携野酌随阴坐，醉听溪童隔水讴。\n城市绝怜丘壑地，不须更问五湖秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25984,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游慈恩寺二首 其二","author":"萧显","text":"海水周遭寺若浮，忽惊人世有沧洲。\n塔铃昼语诸天近，石藉凉生五月秋。\n鹤避茶烟归别院，燕冲花雨度重楼。\n酒酣不尽登临兴，击节聊为马上讴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25985,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永光寺送大参周子建","author":"萧显","text":"春风将解潞河冰，把酒分歧意未能。\n山寺有僧留夜榻，野航无伴对寒灯。\n江南芳草随人绿，海上遥山隔树层。\n踏遍中原今万里，五云高处看飞腾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25986,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端溪研","author":"萧显","text":"千年山骨漱江流，谁凿端溪一片秋。\n清润每疑含宿雾，澄泓长似注寒湫。\n玉堂有客凭挥翰，油幕何人待运筹。\n因意通家王太史，并将珠玉为君投。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25987,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听雨亭联句","author":"萧显","text":"咫尺知心念久违，玉堂空负小盆池。\n鸣阶雨骤留窗霁，隔院香清许座移。\n为惜残红还拥盖，不须浮白已成诗。\n明年此会应无阻，珍重高轩再过之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25988,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚榆堂联句","author":"萧显","text":"吉日鸠工兆墨新，旌麾忽过拥比邻。\n敢云庆泽流来远，莫厌公馀到此频。\n采采凤鸾能接武，飞飞燕雀故依人。\n吾家孙子休言隘，玉宇琼楼一样春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25989,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东楼联句","author":"萧显","text":"临池老肘挥柔翰，点缀深惭墨与丹。\n妙到钟王真未易，饮兼文字古犹难。\n溪云过槛蛟龙近，海宇当楼眼界宽。\n一曲清歌时送酒，倩谁移入画图看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25990,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过君山","author":"萧显","text":"万丈水晶宫，一点青螺湿。\n云暗鼎龙归，竹随湘女泣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25991,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老松","author":"萧显","text":"材大难为用，谁将此老悲。\n空山独高洁，不怕雪霜欺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25992,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小景杂咏","author":"萧显","text":"木脱青山下，亭开翠水涯。\n孤舟荡双桨，何处访相知。\n碧树俯清流，高人爱独坐。\n读罢发长吟，不知斜日堕。\n春思日无涯，春园景最赊。\n蜻蜓缘底事，飞上海棠花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25993,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘令次陆鼎仪韵","author":"萧显","text":"黄金台上暮云层，惆怅无媒欠一登。\n暂敛声光归旧洞，缘萝阴底看阳冰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25994,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"围春堂杂兴 其一","author":"萧显","text":"数椽茅屋薜萝深，卧听樵歌自远林。\n罢却琴书间却钓，不知何处有机心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25995,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"围春堂杂兴 其二","author":"萧显","text":"采采黄花满径深，萧萧红叶满秋林。\n无端此日相思处，千里书来一寸心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25996,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨香亭","author":"萧显","text":"白云司远望中深，瑟瑟秋风奏晚林。\n惆怅关门吟赏处，满篱黄菊故人心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25997,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题郑时晖绣衣画梅和张东海武选韵","author":"萧显","text":"清夜珊珊响佩瑶，罗浮梦断酒初消。\n美人何处游仙去，独有遗容傍野桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25998,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游武夷九曲和朱公先正韵 其一","author":"萧显","text":"九曲仙踪护百灵，仙童时弄玉箫清。\n轻摇画舫寻真去，时听飞泉漱玉声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25999,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游武夷九曲和朱公先正韵 其二","author":"萧显","text":"晴日曈曈薄暮开，九湾新涨碧澶回。\n山灵莫道兹游晚，还许春风鼓枻来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26000,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赏花有跋","author":"贺钦","text":"落尽群芳枝巳空，游人往往怨东风。\n谁知寂莫幽园里，犹着楸花一树红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26001,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋与同寅团亭赏月","author":"叶元玉","text":"八月忽又半，诸公集此亭。\n此亭幽且䆳，贮月不用扃。\n娟娟一轮满，碾破秋天清。\n天空净如洗，点翳无留停。\n有酒多且旨，有殽椒斯馨。\n有客况骨肉，言笑俱忘形。\n酒酣各赋诗，琳琅响中庭。\n光燄不可秘，翻恐劳天丁。\n人生类萍梗，南北随飘零。\n去去看月伴，落落如辰星。\n今夕复何夕，不饮空自醒。\n夜深凉露下，月侧窥疏棂。\n人散天宇阔，西风吹鹤翎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26002,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]